| Harmonic | Wavelength | Frequency |
| ---------: | -----------: | ----------: |
| 0 | ${Math.round(34300/freq)} cm | ${freq} Hz |
| 1 | ${Math.round(34300/(freq * 2))} cm | ${freq * 2} Hz |
| 2 | ${Math.round(34300/(freq * 3))} cm | ${freq * 3} Hz |
| 3 | ${Math.round(34300/(freq * 4))} cm | ${freq * 4} Hz | 
